  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Core Framework**\n\nI\'m focusing on defining the core framework for \"Study Flow\". It\'s envisioned as a comprehensive student study corner. Currently, I\'m prioritizing the integration of AI tools, specifically using `gemini-api`, to provide an AI Tutor. I\'m imagining it will feature conversational abilities, explain formulas, and even generate diagrams.\n\n\n**Refining Project Scope**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics. I\'m imagining SVG/Mermaid or markdown diagrams, optional assessments. Next I will build an AI Study Roadmap that can generate a structured daily schedule. It will be built from syllabus/chapter and study time/deadline inputs. I\'m also planning to build an AI Paper Analyzer, that can classify questions and provide prioritized revision recommendations. I\'m thinking of building a modern, futuristic design, with a dark navy background.\nI also need to check requirements for data storage, and the option of using firebase and cloudsql, or local storage.\n\n\n"
