    response: "### Study Flow \342\200\224 \"Your Studies, Your Pace, Your Success\"\n\n**Study Flow** is an educational platform and personal study companion designed for school and college students preparing for examinations.\n\n---\n\n### Core Features & Architecture\n\n1. **AI Personal Tutor**\n   - **Interactive Socratic Dialogue:** Explains concepts step-by-step with real-world analogies, derivations, and exam tips.\n   - **Formulas & Mathematics:** Formatted mathematical notation, fractions, superscripts, and worked equations.\n   - **Conceptual Diagrams:** Generates standalone, responsive vector diagrams for physics systems, biology cycles, data structures, and geometry.\n   - **Knowledge Assessments:** One-click *\"Quiz Me\"* button that generates multiple-choice questions with answer analysis and explanations.\n   - **Saved Sessions:** Manage multiple study sessions, delete or resume past chats, and send explanations directly to **My Notes**.\n   - **Multimodal Uploads:** Support for attaching problem sheets, diagrams, and documents (PDF/images up to 25MB) directly to the tutor.\n\n2. **AI Study Roadmap**\n   - **Paced Daily Schedules:** Generates realistic, balanced day-by-day plans based on the student\'s daily available study time (20\342\200\223240 min) and exam deadline.\n   - **Syllabus & Chapter Uploads:** Paste topics or upload PDF/image syllabi, or choose from preloaded curricula (AP Calculus AB, Organic Chemistry, Computer Science Algorithms).\n   - **Interactive Checklist:** Check off tasks in real-time, recalculating overall percentage and invested study hours.\n   - **Seamless Tutor Integration:** Every task includes a *\"Start Learning with AI Tutor\"* button that opens the tutor with the prompt and context pre-filled.\n\n3. **AI Exam Paper Analyzer**\n   - **Question Difficulty Classification:** Automatically classifies each exam question into **Easy**, **Moderate**, or **Hard** with pedagogical justifications and marks weightage.\n   - **Topic Prioritisation Matrix:** Groups questions into **High**, **Medium**, and **Low** revision priorities, explaining the strategic reasoning (weightage, foundational prerequisites, exam frequency).\n   - **Strategic Revision Timeline:** Outlines prioritized steps to maximize test scores.\n   - **Interactive Solutions:** Each analyzed question features an *\"Ask Tutor to Solve\"* button to walk through the exact solution.\n\n4. **Focus Tools & Productivity**\n   - **Pomodoro Timer:** Configurable focus intervals (Standard 25/5, Deep Work 50/10, Ultra Exam 90/15, or custom inputs) with circular progress indicators.\n   - **Stopwatch:** Lap tracking for timed mock exam sections and speed practice.\n   - **Audio & Ambient Noise:** Web Audio API sound synthesis for timer chimes, pink rainfall ambience, and binaural white noise without external dependencies.\n   - **Auto-Logging:** Completed focus blocks and stopwatch sessions automatically save to the **My Progress** dashboard.\n\n5. **My Progress Dashboard**\n   - **Study Time Analytics:** Total study hours, 7-day focus distribution graph, and study streak counter.\n   - **Roadmap Completion Rate:** Overall percentage, tasks completed, and active roadmap tracking.\n   - **Assessment Performance:** Quiz scores, topic performance, and mastery percentage.\n   - **Session History:** Log of past Pomodoro and practice sessions.\n\n6. **My Notes & Formula Bank**\n   - **Subject Categorization:** Filter notes by Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, Biology, Computer Science, and General.\n   - **Formula Bank:** Dedicated filter for equation sheets and high-yield cheatsheets.\n   - **Markdown & Math Rendering:** Clean formatting with copy-to-clipboard and instant search across titles, contents, and tags.\n\n7. **Design & Aesthetics**\n   - Dark navy and deep charcoal background (`#0b0f19`) with purple and electric violet accents.\n   - Glowing highlights, rounded cards, and responsive desktop/mobile navigation sidebar."
    modified_response: "### Study Flow \342\200\224 \"Your Studies, Your Pace, Your Success\"\n\n**Study Flow** is an educational platform and personal study companion designed for school and college students preparing for examinations.\n\n---\n\n### Core Features & Architecture\n\n1. **AI Personal Tutor**\n   - **Interactive Socratic Dialogue:** Explains concepts step-by-step with real-world analogies, derivations, and exam tips.\n   - **Formulas & Mathematics:** Formatted mathematical notation, fractions, superscripts, and worked equations.\n   - **Conceptual Diagrams:** Generates standalone, responsive vector diagrams for physics systems, biology cycles, data structures, and geometry.\n   - **Knowledge Assessments:** One-click *\"Quiz Me\"* button that generates multiple-choice questions with answer analysis and explanations.\n   - **Saved Sessions:** Manage multiple study sessions, delete or resume past chats, and send explanations directly to **My Notes**.\n   - **Multimodal Uploads:** Support for attaching problem sheets, diagrams, and documents (PDF/images up to 25MB) directly to the tutor.\n\n2. **AI Study Roadmap**\n   - **Paced Daily Schedules:** Generates realistic, balanced day-by-day plans based on the student\'s daily available study time (20\342\200\223240 min) and exam deadline.\n   - **Syllabus & Chapter Uploads:** Paste topics or upload PDF/image syllabi, or choose from preloaded curricula (AP Calculus AB, Organic Chemistry, Computer Science Algorithms).\n   - **Interactive Checklist:** Check off tasks in real-time, recalculating overall percentage and invested study hours.\n   - **Seamless Tutor Integration:** Every task includes a *\"Start Learning with AI Tutor\"* button that opens the tutor with the prompt and context pre-filled.\n\n3. **AI Exam Paper Analyzer**\n   - **Question Difficulty Classification:** Automatically classifies each exam question into **Easy**, **Moderate**, or **Hard** with pedagogical justifications and marks weightage.\n   - **Topic Prioritisation Matrix:** Groups questions into **High**, **Medium**, and **Low** revision priorities, explaining the strategic reasoning (weightage, foundational prerequisites, exam frequency).\n   - **Strategic Revision Timeline:** Outlines prioritized steps to maximize test scores.\n   - **Interactive Solutions:** Each analyzed question features an *\"Ask Tutor to Solve\"* button to walk through the exact solution.\n\n4. **Focus Tools & Productivity**\n   - **Pomodoro Timer:** Configurable focus intervals (Standard 25/5, Deep Work 50/10, Ultra Exam 90/15, or custom inputs) with circular progress indicators.\n   - **Stopwatch:** Lap tracking for timed mock exam sections and speed practice.\n   - **Audio & Ambient Noise:** Web Audio API sound synthesis for timer chimes, pink rainfall ambience, and binaural white noise without external dependencies.\n   - **Auto-Logging:** Completed focus blocks and stopwatch sessions automatically save to the **My Progress** dashboard.\n\n5. **My Progress Dashboard**\n   - **Study Time Analytics:** Total study hours, 7-day focus distribution graph, and study streak counter.\n   - **Roadmap Completion Rate:** Overall percentage, tasks completed, and active roadmap tracking.\n   - **Assessment Performance:** Quiz scores, topic performance, and mastery percentage.\n   - **Session History:** Log of past Pomodoro and practice sessions.\n\n6. **My Notes & Formula Bank**\n   - **Subject Categorization:** Filter notes by Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, Biology, Computer Science, and General.\n   - **Formula Bank:** Dedicated filter for equation sheets and high-yield cheatsheets.\n   - **Markdown & Math Rendering:** Clean formatting with copy-to-clipboard and instant search across titles, contents, and tags.\n\n7. **Design & Aesthetics**\n   - Dark navy and deep charcoal background (`#0b0f19`) with purple and electric violet accents.\n   - Glowing highlights, rounded cards, and responsive desktop/mobile navigation sidebar."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
