rd model, without switching to paid services or using deprecated models.\n\n6. **Preservation of All Existing Features**\n   - Full conversational memory across multiple saved sessions.\n   - Standalone SVG conceptual diagram rendering and formula formatting.\n   - Interactive assessment quizzes and *\"Save to My Notes\"* functionality.\n   - Integration with the AI Study Roadmap and Exam Paper Analyzer.\n\n7. **Interactive Error Simulation Testing**\n   - Added a testing mode selector in the AI Tutor header (`Live AI`, `Test 503`, `Test 429`, `Test 401`, `Test Network Error`) to verify the error card, question preservation, and retry workflows directly."
