    content: "   - Net yield: **2 ATP + 2 NADH**\n   - Anaerobic (requires no O2)\n\n2. **Pyruvate Decarboxylation** (Mitochondrial Matrix)\n   - 2 Pyruvate -> 2 Acetyl-CoA + 2 CO2 + 2 NADH\n\n3. **Krebs / Citric Acid Cycle** (Mitochondrial Matrix)\n   - Per glucose (2 turns): **2 ATP (GTP) + 6 NADH + 2 FADH2 + 4 CO2**\n\n4. **Oxidative Phosphorylation & Electron Transport Chain** (Inner Membrane)\n   - Chemiosmosis driven by proton gradient across inner membrane.\n   - Theoretical yield: ~30-32 ATP per glucose molecule.\n   - Final electron acceptor: **Oxygen (O2)**, forming H2O!`,\n    createdAt: Date.now() - 86400000 * 2,\n    updatedAt: Date.now() - 86400000 * 2,\n  }\n];\n\nconst initialProgress: UserProgressData = {\n  totalStudyMinutes: 185,\n  sessionsCompleted: 6,\n  streakDays: 4,\n  lastStudyDate: new Date().toISOString().split(\'T\')[0],\n  sessionLogs: [\n    {\n      id: \'session-1\',\n      type: \'pomodoro\',\n      durationMinutes: 25,\n      topic: \'Calculus Limit Definitions\',\n      completedAt: Date.now() - 86400000 * 2,\n    },\n    {\n      id: \'session-2\',\n      type: \'pomodoro\',\n      durationMinutes: 25,\n      topic: \'Cellular Respiration Review\',\n      completedAt: Date.now() - 86400000 * 1.5,\n    },\n    {\n      id: \'session-3\',\n      type: \'pomodoro\',\n      durationMinutes: 50,\n      topic: \'Organic Reaction Mechanisms\',\n      completedAt: Date.now() - 86400000 * 0.8,\n    },\n    {\n      id: \'session-4\',\n      type: \'stopwatch\',\n      durationMinutes: 45,\n      topic: \'Physics Momentum & Collisions Practice\',\n      completedAt: Date.now() - 86400000 * 0.2,\n    },\n    {\n      id: \'session-5\',\n      type: \'pomodoro\',\n      durationMinutes: 40,\n      topic: \'Chain Rule & Optimization Problems\',\n      completedAt: Date.now() - 1000 * 60 * 60 * 3,\n    }\n  ],\n  assessmentRecords: [\n    {\n      id: \'quiz-1\',\n      topic: \'Limits & Differentiability\',\n      score: 3,\n      totalQuesti