    thinking: "**Revising Storage Logic**\n\nI\'ve just been updating `src/services/storage.ts`. I made sure that all tasks in the `initialRoadmap` now default to `completed: false`. I\'ve also implemented `cleanInitialProgress` with `totalStudyMinutes` initialized to zero, and the number of `sessionsCompleted` set to zero, to ensure a clean slate when data is initialized.\n\n\n**Refining Legacy Data Handling**\n\nI\'ve been working on refining how the application handles potentially legacy user progress data, and making the data safe for users. Specifically, I\'m cleaning up `getProgress()` to handle cases where users might have been using fake session logs or other dummy data in local storage. Now the method automatically cleans that data, and ensures it uses a clean slate, to prevent any unforeseen issues.\n\n\n**Updating Roadmap Handling**\n\nI\'ve been working on a method for the storage service to get and safely handle roadmaps stored in `localStorage`. The logic ensures a fresh start if no data is found, and crucially, prevents the persistence of legacy pre-completed tasks in the \"sample-calc-roadmap\". I\'m also handling potential JSON parsing errors by returning a default `initialRoadmap` to maintain data integrity. Finally, I\'ve added a reset progress method.\n\n\n"
