  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Dummy Data**\n\nI\'ve been examining lines 45-47 of `ProgressDashboardView.tsx`, specifically focusing on the dummy distribution calculation based on session logs. The days of the week array and day values have caught my attention, and I\'m now digging into their relationship to the overall dashboard data.\n\n\n**Calculating Weekly Minutes**\n\nI\'ve shifted my focus to accurately calculate weekly study minutes. I\'ve formulated `getWeeklyMinutes`, which iterates through the last seven days, extracting study durations from `progress.sessionLogs`. The logic filters logs by date and sums the durations. If no logs exist for a day, the minutes default to zero. Finally, a message for the user will appear if there are no session logs at all.\n\n\n"
