    thinking: "**Analyzing Skill Requirements**\n\nI\'m currently focused on evaluating the skill requirements. I\'ve identified that enhancing AI response speed and streaming for the Gemini API, or `gemini-api`, is central to the task at hand. I\'m now examining `gemini_api` SKILL.md to verify its relevance.\n\n\n"
