    thinking: "**Analyzing Server Logic**\n\nI\'m currently focused on dissecting the `server.ts` file. I\'ve noted the import of `GoogleGenAI`, `Type`, and `ThinkingLevel` from `@google/genai`. I\'m also examining the implementation for streaming, specifically the addition of the `app.post(\'/api/tutor/chat/stream\', async` endpoint.\n\n\n**Optimizing Token Usage**\n\nI\'ve realized reducing prompt token processing is critical. I am updating the logic for the conversation history: only the last six messages will be preserved. I am also thinking about ways of keeping only the initial context, with a max of 6 total turns. Regarding the `ThinkingLevel`, I am now implementing `ThinkingLevel.LOW` for fast responses. I am also now setting up the SSE headers and streaming logic within the server.\n\n\n**Refining Error Handling**\n\nI\'m now diving into robust error management within the server\'s streaming implementation. I\'m focusing on catching errors pre and post-header sending. Specifically, I am updating the system to handle different error scenarios, like quota limits (429 errors), providing user-friendly messages and appropriate status codes within the SSE stream. The non-streaming chat endpoint is also being refined for fallbacks.\n\n\n"
